  "notes": "Apply index 7 of 11; envelope stage 0, cluster 0, position 5. GAPVWIR6\u2026 calls muxed_id(WCGU5KUW\u2026) on CCGU5KUW\u2026; the W\u2026 address is CCGU5KUW\u2026 (key 8d4eaa96\u20266859) with ID 42, and the return value is u64 42. The call is read-only: no ledger entry changes besides the source's fee and sequence number, so the contract is not a participant and the W\u2026 address appears only in the envelope. The fee events charge 6488 and refund -4808 (fee_charged 1680). Written live by stellar-core 30.0.0. Testnet is reset on 2026-12-16; the vendored object will then be the only copy."
